<title>USA: Nature's Sunshine sets new stock buyback.</title>
<headline>Nature's Sunshine sets new stock buyback.</headline>
<dateline>PROVO, Utah 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nature's Sunshine Products Inc said Wednesday its board had approved a new stock repurchase plan covering up to 500,000 shares.</p>
<p>The new plan is in addition to the 500,000-share buyback authorized last October. That buyback has been completed.</p>
<p>The company said the board adopted the new buyback plan because it believes the stock is an attractive investment. The stock will be purchased in the open market and will be used for general purposes.</p>
<p>Nature's Sunshine manufactures and markets encapsulated herbs and vitamins.</p>
</text>
